--- a/.mailmap
+++ b/.mailmap
@@ -64,6 +64,7 @@ Alex Elder <elder@kernel.org> <elder@ieee.org>
 Alex Elder <elder@kernel.org> <elder@inktank.com>
 Alex Elder <elder@kernel.org> <elder@linaro.org>
